MCJ Create Train Client Position Compatibility 1.0.5
Own companion code: MIT, see LICENSE. Copyright 2026 Roman Glos.

Preserves Create's own carriage interpolation during ordinary full and delta
entity-position packets for initialized non-derailed client carriages, whether
the local player rides that carriage or observes it from outside. Initial
placement and exceptional full syncs over 64 blocks keep vanilla recovery.
Entity position codecs and Create carriage data remain processed. Explicit
teleport/vehicle handlers, entity authority methods and outgoing packets are
unchanged. No third-party classes or reference binary are bundled.
